WEBVTT

01:40.920 --> 01:43.440
You really are a clean
and honest young official.

01:46.760 --> 01:47.760
But I don't like it

01:47.840 --> 01:49.640
when you talk to me so seriously.

01:50.200 --> 01:51.360
It makes me uncomfortable.

01:51.440 --> 01:52.680
On your knees.

01:52.760 --> 01:54.040
Your Highness.

01:54.600 --> 01:55.440
Kneel.

02:06.480 --> 02:08.280
Astounding.

02:08.759 --> 02:10.919
Even the way you kneel

02:11.000 --> 02:12.680
looks better than other men.

02:13.480 --> 02:15.080
You flatter me, Your Highness.

02:15.800 --> 02:17.920
I dislike government integrity,

02:18.640 --> 02:21.040
cleanliness, and honesty.

02:21.120 --> 02:23.640
I like the way you look in front of me,

02:24.240 --> 02:26.000
with all your emotions kept inside.

02:27.640 --> 02:28.880
Yurong.

02:29.440 --> 02:30.680
Play along, won't you?

02:30.760 --> 02:32.520
Your plan is an unprecedented one.

02:33.040 --> 02:34.560
This is a national affair.

02:35.120 --> 02:36.280
I can't do as you say.

02:37.160 --> 02:39.480
It's rare for you to be so firm.

02:40.560 --> 02:41.440
Very well.

02:42.040 --> 02:42.920
Rise and eat.

02:48.160 --> 02:50.520
GOVERN PEOPLE, SERVE THE HEAVENS

02:50.600 --> 02:52.480
The Annual Exam
is on the 10th of next month.

02:52.560 --> 02:53.840
As for the guidelines and rules,

02:54.320 --> 02:55.600
they are in the memorial.

03:06.880 --> 03:08.560
I feel at ease leaving the Annual Exam

03:08.640 --> 03:09.480
in your hands.

03:11.840 --> 03:13.880
Your Majesty, the Eldest Princess
wishes to see you.

03:23.680 --> 03:24.520
Your Majesty.

03:27.400 --> 03:29.000
Mr. Shen is here too.

03:29.960 --> 03:31.760
Am I interrupting your conversation?

03:32.440 --> 03:33.280
Not at all.

03:34.760 --> 03:36.160
That concludes my report.

03:36.240 --> 03:37.440
I'll take my leave.

03:40.880 --> 03:41.720
Mr. Shen.

03:43.000 --> 03:44.600
I came up with an idea

03:44.680 --> 03:46.120
and I'd like your opinion on it.

03:52.200 --> 03:54.320
I heard the Annual Exam
is just around the corner.

03:55.120 --> 03:57.360
The questions are mostly the same yearly.

03:57.440 --> 03:59.520
We never got any remarkable talents.

03:59.600 --> 04:03.400
I have a better idea
for the exam this year.

04:03.480 --> 04:04.480
What might it be?

04:05.000 --> 04:07.480
Why not let the men
and women compete in teams?

04:09.040 --> 04:09.880
Nonsense.

04:10.680 --> 04:13.600
The teachings in the Imperial Academy
and School of Integrity are different.

04:13.680 --> 04:15.320
How could men and women
take the same exam?

04:15.400 --> 04:18.680
Do you assume the noblewomen

04:18.760 --> 04:21.120
would be a liability
for the gentlemen of the capital?

04:22.400 --> 04:23.880
- That's not--
- Your Majesty.

04:25.120 --> 04:26.440
Do not forget.

04:27.080 --> 04:30.200
I was sent away as a hostage
to bring peace to the Great Yan.

04:31.760 --> 04:34.360
Aren't you sitting steadily on that throne

04:35.720 --> 04:36.560
thanks to me?

04:41.400 --> 04:43.840
So do not underestimate women.

04:44.320 --> 04:45.920
At a crucial time,

04:47.400 --> 04:48.920
we can be as capable as men.

04:49.960 --> 04:51.360
It's high time you gave them

04:51.440 --> 04:53.320
a chance to compete with men.

04:56.920 --> 04:59.240
What do you think of this idea, Mr. Shen?

05:10.920 --> 05:11.800
Very well.

05:12.880 --> 05:14.080
Let's proceed with your idea.

05:15.880 --> 05:16.920
Thank you, Your Majesty.

05:24.640 --> 05:28.480
GOVERN PEOPLE, SERVE THE HEAVENS

05:37.840 --> 05:38.800
Yurong.

05:39.560 --> 05:41.560
I came here today because of you,

05:42.320 --> 05:45.240
so do not be wayward again next time.

05:46.200 --> 05:48.040
Lest you want me to show you

05:48.120 --> 05:49.640
how to be obedient.

06:13.440 --> 06:18.200
TAIJI HALL

06:31.280 --> 06:32.120
JIANG RESIDENCE

06:32.200 --> 06:33.360
Just a light stroke.

06:33.440 --> 06:34.280
Like so?

06:37.240 --> 06:38.440
Not bad.

06:40.080 --> 06:41.080
Jiang Li!

06:41.560 --> 06:42.720
Jiang Li.

06:43.520 --> 06:45.240
I have an interesting thing to tell you.

06:46.000 --> 06:46.880
What is it?

06:47.560 --> 06:50.520
The Imperial Academy and School
of Integrity will have a joint Annual Exam

06:50.600 --> 06:52.240
where men and women will team up.

06:52.320 --> 06:53.760
That has never been done before.

06:55.280 --> 06:57.400
Why is there such a unique exam?

06:57.480 --> 06:58.480
You know nothing.

06:58.560 --> 06:59.760
The new Annual Exam system

06:59.840 --> 07:01.160
was approved by His Majesty.

07:01.720 --> 07:03.360
And the top scholar, Shen Yurong,

07:03.440 --> 07:04.800
is already setting it up.

07:04.880 --> 07:06.000
And I heard

07:06.080 --> 07:07.520
His Majesty will personally meet

07:07.600 --> 07:09.600
the first placers in this Annual Exam.

07:11.720 --> 07:13.360
This is a chance of a lifetime.

07:13.440 --> 07:15.760
Who do you think I should team up with?

07:15.840 --> 07:16.680
Me.

07:19.920 --> 07:20.760
You?

07:31.360 --> 07:32.360
Goodness.

07:32.440 --> 07:33.600
It hurts.

07:34.240 --> 07:35.080
Jiang Li.

07:35.680 --> 07:38.160
You must at least get
into the School of Integrity first.

07:38.240 --> 07:39.320
However,

07:39.400 --> 07:41.760
I must talk you out
of this ridiculous idea.

07:41.840 --> 07:43.480
The School of Integrity

07:43.560 --> 07:44.840
is for the daughters

07:44.920 --> 07:48.560
of beautiful talents
from families of officials in the capital.

07:48.640 --> 07:49.920
Your looks

07:50.000 --> 07:51.040
are somewhat passable.

07:51.120 --> 07:52.120
But it's

07:52.200 --> 07:53.600
quite a unique beauty.

07:53.680 --> 07:54.880
As for talent…

07:55.960 --> 07:57.640
You have a long way to go!

07:59.000 --> 08:00.920
Even if Uncle Yuanbai
pulls some strings for you

08:01.000 --> 08:02.680
and gets you into the School of Integrity,

08:02.760 --> 08:04.760
you'll still get eliminated.

08:05.280 --> 08:08.640
You'll be the greatest laughingstock
in the capital.

08:11.320 --> 08:13.080
It's not bad

08:13.160 --> 08:14.240
to give people a good laugh.

08:14.320 --> 08:16.520
Why are you so undaunted?

08:16.600 --> 08:18.160
Uncle Yuanbai will never let you go.

08:18.240 --> 08:19.600
Let's have a bet.

08:19.680 --> 08:20.920
If you get in,

08:21.000 --> 08:23.960
Little Backbone and I

08:24.040 --> 08:26.160
will do a handstand and walk around

08:26.240 --> 08:27.080
the Imperial Academy.

08:32.840 --> 08:34.280
Can you do a handstand?

08:35.039 --> 08:37.320
Show us now if you can.

08:39.880 --> 08:40.919
You…

08:41.000 --> 08:42.080
You two…

08:43.080 --> 08:44.280
I won't argue with you!

08:55.520 --> 08:58.920
Why don't I see Bingji these days?

08:59.000 --> 09:00.400
According to Madam Ji,

09:00.480 --> 09:02.480
Bingji has caught a cold recently.

09:03.080 --> 09:04.440
She will visit you

09:04.520 --> 09:05.800
when he gets well.

09:08.840 --> 09:11.640
Using a child for a show of displeasure.

09:15.040 --> 09:17.040
Old Madam,
Ms. Jiang Li requested to see you.

09:17.960 --> 09:18.840
Let her in.

09:27.760 --> 09:28.640
Grandmother.

09:28.720 --> 09:29.960
Li'er.

09:30.040 --> 09:31.880
Why the sudden visit?

09:31.960 --> 09:33.480
I came to thank you.

09:34.440 --> 09:36.400
Bai Xue is kind, thoughtful,

09:36.480 --> 09:38.000
and agile too.

09:38.080 --> 09:39.120
She's a rare find.

09:39.200 --> 09:41.320
She is your maid now.

09:41.960 --> 09:43.840
Instruct her with care.

09:44.400 --> 09:45.240
Grandmother.

09:46.040 --> 09:48.240
I have a request.

09:50.320 --> 09:51.160
Sit.

09:54.960 --> 09:57.120
I'm listening. What's up?

09:57.200 --> 09:59.600
I've been in Zhennv Hall for ten years

10:00.440 --> 10:02.120
and I have a notorious reputation.

10:02.200 --> 10:04.360
Now, Father brought me back

10:04.920 --> 10:06.960
and the Jiang family
made me look dignified.

10:07.720 --> 10:09.520
But to other people,

10:09.600 --> 10:11.600
I am always the same sinner.

10:13.960 --> 10:14.960
Li'er.

10:15.960 --> 10:17.720
You're overthinking.

10:18.280 --> 10:19.160
Grandmother.

10:20.440 --> 10:22.800
I'd like to study
at the School of Integrity.

10:22.880 --> 10:24.080
First, to hone my character

10:24.160 --> 10:27.520
and second, to make a name for myself.

10:28.080 --> 10:30.320
It's great for a woman
to pursue knowledge.

10:30.400 --> 10:31.680
Do you think so too?

10:31.760 --> 10:32.840
Certainly.

10:33.440 --> 10:35.400
People should know

10:35.480 --> 10:38.320
the kind of person you are.

10:40.440 --> 10:41.320
Grandmother.

10:41.960 --> 10:42.840
Look.

10:43.960 --> 10:45.480
I wrote this.

10:50.320 --> 10:51.320
Good handwriting.

10:54.080 --> 10:57.000
The Zhennv Hall
is not a place for studying and writing.

10:57.080 --> 10:58.720
You must have practiced hard.

10:59.560 --> 11:01.200
Earning your praise

11:01.280 --> 11:02.600
was worth the effort.

11:03.840 --> 11:04.800
Come.

11:07.680 --> 11:10.200
Your father has
excellent handwriting as well.

11:11.200 --> 11:14.000
But after becoming the Chancellor,

11:14.080 --> 11:15.600
random words he writes

11:16.080 --> 11:18.960
become a treasured calligraphy to others.

11:19.920 --> 11:21.440
So he stopped writing.

11:24.680 --> 11:27.840
Show these writings to him.

11:27.920 --> 11:29.080
He will be thrilled.

11:29.640 --> 11:32.640
Then ask him to send you to the school.

11:32.720 --> 11:36.320
And I'll prepare
the Four Treasures of Study for you.

11:39.680 --> 11:40.920
I don't dare to.

11:45.160 --> 11:48.480
Are you concerned
this might displease someone?

11:50.560 --> 11:51.920
Do not be concerned.

11:52.000 --> 11:54.480
I'm keeping this.

11:55.200 --> 11:58.560
I'll tell your father about this.

11:59.320 --> 12:00.360
Thank you.

12:01.440 --> 12:03.320
Have some pear soup.

12:04.080 --> 12:04.920
All right.

12:07.200 --> 12:09.360
This is Li'er's handwriting.

12:09.440 --> 12:10.760
What do you think?

12:10.840 --> 12:12.720
Neat but forceful.

12:13.320 --> 12:15.760
Straight but sharp.

12:16.560 --> 12:18.320
So you think it's good too.

12:18.880 --> 12:20.200
Is this enough to enroll her

12:20.280 --> 12:22.320
in the School of Integrity?

12:24.080 --> 12:27.360
Does Li'er want to study
at the School of Integrity?

12:27.840 --> 12:28.960
What do you think?

12:33.200 --> 12:34.400
Well…

12:34.480 --> 12:36.080
I'm glad that Li'er

12:36.160 --> 12:37.560
is passionate about learning.

12:38.560 --> 12:41.880
But the School of Integrity
is unlike other private schools.

12:42.600 --> 12:44.080
Every year, women would get expelled

12:44.160 --> 12:46.640
due to lackluster results.

12:47.360 --> 12:50.200
Li'er barely had an education before this.

12:50.760 --> 12:54.880
I'm worried the people there
might give her a hard time.

12:56.680 --> 12:58.800
Yuanbai is the Chief Secretariat.

12:59.360 --> 13:00.400
His children

13:00.480 --> 13:03.400
must not be illiterate
and mocked by the people.

13:03.480 --> 13:05.760
After years in Zhennv Hall,

13:05.840 --> 13:07.880
Li'er still managed
to have remarkable handwriting.

13:07.960 --> 13:10.240
She obviously worked hard
to accomplish this.

13:10.320 --> 13:11.920
Bullies won't dwindle her spirit.

13:12.440 --> 13:13.480
I think

13:14.080 --> 13:15.200
this handwriting

13:15.760 --> 13:17.760
is better than Ruoyao's, whom you raised.

13:25.600 --> 13:27.320
Indeed, Old Madam.

13:28.320 --> 13:30.880
However, we don't get to decide

13:30.960 --> 13:32.520
if Li'er can be admitted there.

13:32.600 --> 13:33.720
Dear,

13:34.200 --> 13:35.880
we can hire a teacher

13:35.960 --> 13:37.240
to test Li'er's knowledge.

13:37.840 --> 13:39.640
Knowing her capability

13:39.720 --> 13:41.840
is the best for her and the family.

13:43.760 --> 13:44.920
That makes sense.

13:45.000 --> 13:46.200
Ask Yuanping

13:46.680 --> 13:49.680
to hire the teacher
who has taught Jiang Jingrui before.

13:50.440 --> 13:52.960
He is experienced and sharp.

13:53.520 --> 13:54.480
He once said

13:54.560 --> 13:57.360
that Jingrui would be recommended
to the Imperial Academy.

13:57.440 --> 13:58.480
And he was right.

13:58.560 --> 13:59.560
Yes.

14:00.080 --> 14:01.600
I'll go to Yuanping later.

14:02.320 --> 14:03.160
Wait, dear.

14:04.120 --> 14:06.560
The Imperial Academy
and School of Integrity aren't the same.

14:08.600 --> 14:11.360
Then who do you think we should hire?

14:11.440 --> 14:13.200
I know someone for the task.

14:13.840 --> 14:15.640
If he thinks Jiang Li

14:15.720 --> 14:17.720
can pass the selection
of the School of Integrity,

14:17.800 --> 14:20.080
then people won't criticize our family

14:20.160 --> 14:21.360
and the school.

14:33.760 --> 14:34.720
Mr. Shen.

14:38.160 --> 14:39.000
Chancellor Jiang.

14:39.080 --> 14:40.200
Let's have a word in private.

14:45.880 --> 14:48.760
You are in charge
of the Annual Exam for both institutes.

14:48.840 --> 14:50.840
You've been working hard for many days.

14:51.360 --> 14:53.080
Do you have some time?

14:53.160 --> 14:54.760
Thank you for your concern.

14:54.840 --> 14:56.680
It's my day off. I have some time.

14:57.320 --> 14:58.480
Perfect.

14:58.560 --> 14:59.960
I need a favor from you.

15:00.920 --> 15:04.160
My daughter Jiang Li wants
to enroll in the School of Integrity.

15:04.240 --> 15:05.200
But as you know,

15:05.280 --> 15:07.440
she has never gone to a proper school.

15:07.920 --> 15:10.400
She's your daughter.
Naturally, she will do remarkably.

15:10.960 --> 15:12.280
I hope you are right.

15:13.480 --> 15:15.880
Test her knowledge for me.

15:15.960 --> 15:18.520
Then my wife and I can feel at ease.

15:31.680 --> 15:34.800
Is there a problem, Mr. Shen?

15:36.680 --> 15:38.000
It's a request from an elder.

15:38.080 --> 15:39.880
I'll do my best.

15:40.680 --> 15:41.680
Much appreciated.

15:58.840 --> 15:59.880
Mrs. Jiang.

15:59.960 --> 16:02.480
Mr. Shen, please take a seat.

16:16.280 --> 16:17.200
Have some tea first.

16:17.280 --> 16:19.200
I'll bring Li'er here.

16:24.440 --> 16:25.440
Mr. Shen.

16:26.160 --> 16:28.600
Li'er spent ten years at Zhennv Hall.

16:28.680 --> 16:30.840
If she offends you in any way,

16:30.920 --> 16:32.080
I hope you won't mind.

16:32.920 --> 16:34.000
You're too polite, Madam Ji.

16:37.400 --> 16:38.240
Mr. Shen.

16:43.440 --> 16:44.880
A token of appreciation.

16:53.040 --> 16:55.320
There's no need for such courtesy.

16:56.200 --> 16:58.680
I'll take it that you accept the silver.

16:58.760 --> 17:00.680
Remember to do your job well.

17:01.560 --> 17:03.720
Li'er is our family's legitimate daughter.

17:03.800 --> 17:05.680
It shouldn't be a problem for her to get

17:05.760 --> 17:06.920
into the School of Integrity.

17:07.760 --> 17:10.839
Mr. Shen, please do not disappoint me.

17:22.240 --> 17:24.839
I thought the money was for…

17:25.880 --> 17:28.240
Why are you helping Jiang Li?

17:28.319 --> 17:31.760
Do you know why
I asked Mr. Shen to test her?

17:32.240 --> 17:33.640
I have no idea indeed.

17:33.720 --> 17:36.680
Mr. Shen came from an impoverished family.

17:36.760 --> 17:38.320
When he became the top scorer,

17:38.400 --> 17:40.560
he held a banquet
to meet people in high places,

17:40.640 --> 17:42.240
but no one attended.

17:42.320 --> 17:43.640
It was all for nothing.

17:45.120 --> 17:47.920
Therefore, he hates

17:48.000 --> 17:49.760
the privileged
who throw their weight around.

17:50.240 --> 17:52.920
No money can sway him.

17:53.000 --> 17:54.320
I hired him

17:54.400 --> 17:56.560
so he could hate Jiang Li to the bones.

18:46.320 --> 18:47.880
Greetings, Mr. Shen.

18:51.160 --> 18:52.120
Mr. Shen.

19:10.360 --> 19:11.760
You're being a bit inappropriate.

19:30.280 --> 19:31.840
You remind me…

19:35.120 --> 19:36.000
of an old friend.

19:39.240 --> 19:42.280
I apologize for my inappropriate behavior.

19:45.080 --> 19:47.920
My father often talks about you.

19:49.320 --> 19:50.760
It's an honor

19:51.760 --> 19:54.280
to have your guidance.

19:54.360 --> 19:55.680
The time limit is one incense.

19:56.160 --> 19:59.240
I'll mark the paper
when the incense burns out.

20:10.080 --> 20:11.880
Have you been to Qingcheng Mountain?

20:20.520 --> 20:21.480
Yes.

20:29.160 --> 20:30.720
With whom?

20:34.160 --> 20:35.560
She is gone.

20:36.880 --> 20:38.360
Let's not talk about her anymore.

20:45.880 --> 20:47.680
Are you afraid of thunder?

20:51.720 --> 20:53.000
We shouldn't talk

20:54.160 --> 20:55.880
about personal things.

20:56.760 --> 20:57.840
Ms. Jiang Li.

20:58.880 --> 20:59.720
Show some respect.

21:00.760 --> 21:02.320
The nights of Qingcheng Mountain

21:04.360 --> 21:05.720
are piercing cold.

21:06.960 --> 21:09.240
It's cold enough
to see through everything.

21:10.760 --> 21:12.080
I never understood

21:13.360 --> 21:17.840
why my loved ones were so ruthless.

21:26.640 --> 21:30.840
They made me stay
on Qingcheng Mountain for ten years.

21:34.920 --> 21:36.600
But I get it now.

21:39.400 --> 21:41.400
I saw the money my mother left.

21:42.920 --> 21:44.400
I know I misunderstood.

21:46.080 --> 21:48.400
It turns out
my mother still cares about me.

21:49.280 --> 21:51.480
Therefore, I have a request.

21:52.680 --> 21:54.000
I survived ten years

21:55.760 --> 21:57.960
on Qingcheng Mountain.

21:58.600 --> 22:01.400
Now, I only want to rely on myself.

22:02.440 --> 22:04.320
So I hope you are fair

22:05.360 --> 22:07.480
in your judgment.

22:28.240 --> 22:29.080
ZHONGNAN MOUNTAIN'S
NORTHERN PEAKS ARE BEAUTIFUL

22:29.160 --> 22:30.000
WITH SNOW SEEMINGLY
CONNECTED TO FLOATING CLOUDS

22:30.080 --> 22:30.920
THE SUNSET'S AFTERGLOW
SHINES BETWEEN TREES AFTER SNOWING

22:31.000 --> 22:31.840
THE COLD INTENSIFIES AT NIGHT IN THE CITY

22:34.920 --> 22:36.320
The handwriting…

22:36.400 --> 22:37.560
Mr. Shen.

22:38.920 --> 22:39.760
What do you think?

22:41.520 --> 22:43.040
Can I get into the School of Integrity?

22:46.840 --> 22:48.040
I think

22:49.520 --> 22:50.960
you are indeed talented.

22:53.160 --> 22:54.880
But you need a teacher for a year or two

22:55.640 --> 22:57.320
before getting
into the School of Integrity.

22:57.920 --> 22:59.400
Since I have talent indeed,

23:00.280 --> 23:01.680
why the wait?

23:05.760 --> 23:07.080
Why won't you look at me?

23:12.040 --> 23:14.360
I will inform Chancellor Jiang honestly.

23:14.880 --> 23:15.880
It's getting late.

23:16.440 --> 23:17.280
Goodbye.

23:17.760 --> 23:19.360
Mr. Shen, do you hate me?

23:20.120 --> 23:21.760
Or did I offend you in some way?

23:24.160 --> 23:25.400
Why do you ask?

23:25.480 --> 23:27.080
Why are you doing this to me?

23:30.000 --> 23:31.600
Was it your doing?

23:31.680 --> 23:33.640
Why are you doing this to me?

23:38.720 --> 23:39.560
Why?

23:41.560 --> 23:42.400
You…

23:42.880 --> 23:47.520
People claim that you are ever so noble

23:47.600 --> 23:48.760
and stand against objections

23:50.280 --> 23:52.960
to carve a new path
of Imperial Examination for the poor.

23:53.520 --> 23:54.640
You are a wise

23:55.160 --> 23:56.320
and good official.

23:57.760 --> 23:59.120
I only ask

23:59.200 --> 24:01.000
for a chance to study outside.

24:02.760 --> 24:04.840
You know I am just as good as others.

24:05.520 --> 24:07.280
I deserve to study
in the School of Integrity.

24:08.480 --> 24:12.440
But you are thinking
about writing me off now.

24:13.080 --> 24:15.120
Am I wrong about you

24:16.080 --> 24:18.040
or are the people mistaken?

24:18.600 --> 24:20.840
Do you really have a clear conscience?

24:34.920 --> 24:36.120
Do I have a clear conscience?

24:48.280 --> 24:50.880
IMPROVE VIRTUES
AND EXPAND ACHIEVEMENTS

24:50.960 --> 24:51.800
- Mr. Shen.
- Mr. Shen.

24:53.440 --> 24:54.280
Well?

24:55.360 --> 24:57.360
Is Li'er worthy of the School of Integrity

24:57.440 --> 24:59.560
with her current knowledge?

25:00.800 --> 25:02.600
Despite the years
she spent on the mountain,

25:03.080 --> 25:04.680
having such knowledge

25:04.760 --> 25:06.200
shows that she is gifted

25:06.280 --> 25:07.360
and of profound scholarship.

25:08.240 --> 25:10.400
But the School of Integrity
is meant for female scholars.

25:10.480 --> 25:11.640
I think

25:12.120 --> 25:14.120
she would fare better
if she were taught by a teacher

25:14.200 --> 25:15.680
for another year.

25:18.360 --> 25:19.760
In that case,

25:20.320 --> 25:22.160
we'll proceed with your suggestion.

25:23.640 --> 25:24.960
I'll take my leave.

25:26.080 --> 25:26.920
All right.

25:27.440 --> 25:28.640
I'll see you off.

25:34.360 --> 25:36.160
IMPROVE VIRTUES
AND EXPAND ACHIEVEMENTS

25:44.040 --> 25:46.040
Why are you reading books
for Ruyun's entrance exam?

25:46.760 --> 25:48.160
Ruyun can't learn it.

25:48.240 --> 25:49.960
If I study this, I can teach her.

25:52.360 --> 25:54.040
Do you want to study
in the School of Integrity?

25:58.560 --> 25:59.760
If I weren't married,

26:00.720 --> 26:02.360
I'd check out the school for sure.

26:09.520 --> 26:12.080
JIANG RESIDENCE

26:14.120 --> 26:15.360
Mr. Shen.

26:15.440 --> 26:16.280
Take care.

26:20.920 --> 26:22.200
There is something I admire

26:23.000 --> 26:24.520
about Ms. Jiang Li.

26:25.080 --> 26:26.360
I'm all ears.

26:28.360 --> 26:29.880
I came from an impoverished family.

26:30.360 --> 26:31.800
As an official,

26:31.880 --> 26:34.800
I've seen many who use education
as a front for personal gains.

26:35.360 --> 26:37.520
But Ms. Jiang Li's desire
to pursue knowledge

26:38.000 --> 26:39.040
is truly hard to come by.

26:39.760 --> 26:41.920
It may be hard to get
into the School of Integrity,

26:42.480 --> 26:44.760
but a year's delay
will undermine her desire to learn.

26:45.680 --> 26:46.640
It's not worth it.

27:15.320 --> 27:17.200
I heard Mr. Shen say

27:17.720 --> 27:20.200
it's better to send Jiang Li
to school next year.

27:20.720 --> 27:22.360
Why did his lordship change his mind?

27:22.440 --> 27:25.120
Perhaps Mr. Shen mentioned
something to him

27:25.200 --> 27:26.960
when his lordship saw him off.

27:27.040 --> 27:28.280
But now,

27:28.360 --> 27:30.800
his lordship got someone
to help Jiang Li pack indeed.

27:33.560 --> 27:34.400
Mother!

27:34.920 --> 27:35.840
Mother.

27:35.920 --> 27:37.200
Have you heard?

27:37.280 --> 27:39.320
Jiang Li is leaving
for the School of Integrity.

27:40.520 --> 27:41.800
Go back to your guqin practice.

27:42.360 --> 27:43.400
Mother.

27:43.480 --> 27:45.120
Why didn't you stop her?

27:45.200 --> 27:46.120
Do you expect me

27:46.200 --> 27:48.200
to call her my sister in school?

27:48.280 --> 27:50.880
You dare raise your voice against me
over this trivial matter.

27:50.960 --> 27:53.720
Don't you remember my lesson
on composure since you were little?

27:54.200 --> 27:55.880
Or do you think your privileged background

27:55.960 --> 27:58.760
and outstanding musical talent
are nothing compared to that country girl?

27:59.560 --> 28:01.280
- I--
- Go back to guqin practice.

28:18.520 --> 28:19.960
Any updates from the scouts?

28:20.520 --> 28:22.320
The shop is open.
There's no news as of now.

28:22.920 --> 28:23.920
Watch closely.

28:24.000 --> 28:27.000
Yang Song's dead, so money can't be
taken out of the Bureau of Salt and Iron.

28:27.520 --> 28:29.400
But Li Zhongnan's business goes on.

28:30.360 --> 28:31.480
One link will move the other.

28:32.000 --> 28:33.280
He will make a move.

28:33.760 --> 28:34.600
Yes.

28:34.680 --> 28:35.720
By the way, my lord,

28:36.200 --> 28:38.840
I heard there are big changes
to the Annual Exam this year.

28:40.160 --> 28:41.000
How so?

28:41.480 --> 28:43.120
Eldest Princess Wanning
went to His Majesty

28:43.200 --> 28:45.120
and proposed a joint exam
between the two schools,

28:45.200 --> 28:46.920
making the students take
the exam in teams.

28:47.000 --> 28:48.680
His Majesty already approved it.

28:50.000 --> 28:52.040
Is Shen Yurong still the examiner?

28:52.120 --> 28:53.280
Yes.

28:55.640 --> 28:57.280
The new system is undoubtedly

28:57.360 --> 28:58.880
providing those scholars

28:58.960 --> 29:01.200
a chance to openly form cliques.

29:01.800 --> 29:02.720
Shen Yurong

29:02.800 --> 29:05.640
never openly fawned
over any rich or powerful families.

29:05.720 --> 29:07.360
He hates the forming of factions too.

29:09.200 --> 29:10.560
It seems like

29:11.440 --> 29:13.760
things are quite interesting.

29:13.840 --> 29:15.720
That's not the only interesting thing.

29:15.800 --> 29:18.520
Shen Yurong also helped Jiang Li
get into the School of Integrity.

29:19.840 --> 29:21.840
What a good show.

29:23.840 --> 29:24.800
It's worth watching.

29:28.520 --> 29:32.080
CONCEAL TALENT AND DRAW NO ATTENTION

29:38.520 --> 29:40.880
But why are you so cruel?

29:40.960 --> 29:43.560
You want to destroy my reputation

29:44.680 --> 29:46.760
and kill me here too.

29:47.520 --> 29:49.320
Have you been to Qingcheng Mountain?

29:49.920 --> 29:52.160
The nights of Qingcheng Mountain
are piercing cold.

29:53.440 --> 29:55.640
It's cold enough
to see through everything.

29:56.200 --> 29:57.760
…why my loved ones

29:58.240 --> 30:00.680
were so ruthless.

30:00.760 --> 30:02.320
Mr. Shen, do you hate me?

30:02.400 --> 30:03.640
Why are you doing this to me?

30:03.720 --> 30:04.760
Why?

30:13.160 --> 30:14.000
Yurong?

30:14.840 --> 30:15.920
The food is ready.

30:17.000 --> 30:18.840
Yurong.

30:20.000 --> 30:20.840
Yurong?

30:21.720 --> 30:24.120
Why aren't you answering
and locking yourself up in there?

30:25.360 --> 30:26.920
Come out for dinner.

30:34.080 --> 30:36.080
There's a storm.
Where are you going, Yurong?

31:37.600 --> 31:38.920
JIANG RESIDENCE

31:39.000 --> 31:40.840
As you expected,

31:40.920 --> 31:42.360
someone dug up

31:42.440 --> 31:43.840
her ladyship's grave.

31:43.920 --> 31:45.600
He has always been paranoid.

31:46.240 --> 31:47.920
I think we'll be safe for some time.

31:48.560 --> 31:51.000
It's all thanks to your cautiousness then.

32:04.360 --> 32:05.840
Help her change into my clothing.

32:06.400 --> 32:08.240
She's already gone.

32:08.320 --> 32:09.960
Why should she wear your ragged clothes?

32:11.040 --> 32:11.880
Do as I say first.

32:14.200 --> 32:15.720
I'll explain everything one day.

32:19.600 --> 32:21.200
I just feel sorry for Jiang Li.

32:22.240 --> 32:24.320
Even in death, she couldn't have peace.

32:24.880 --> 32:25.720
Miss.

32:26.280 --> 32:28.840
Her ladyship would surely watch over us.

32:29.560 --> 32:30.840
She won't hold it against you.

32:34.480 --> 32:36.200
We cleared one obstacle.

32:38.760 --> 32:40.000
It's time.

32:40.720 --> 32:41.680
I must leave for school.

32:45.120 --> 32:45.960
Miss.

32:47.240 --> 32:48.600
Can I go with you?

32:49.320 --> 32:51.120
I don't feel at ease that you're alone.

32:52.440 --> 32:55.360
Do you know anyone
who brings her maid to school?

32:57.000 --> 32:59.200
But since we left Zhennv Hall

32:59.280 --> 33:00.560
and came back,

33:00.640 --> 33:01.960
I've never left your side.

33:02.040 --> 33:04.440
At least we'll have each other's back
if anything happens.

33:05.120 --> 33:07.000
If you go to school by yourself,

33:07.760 --> 33:08.600
I'm worried that…

33:09.080 --> 33:11.160
Have I ever gotten
the short end of the stick?

33:12.120 --> 33:13.080
You, on the other hand,

33:13.760 --> 33:14.960
must take good care of yourself

33:15.040 --> 33:16.520
while I'm away.

33:18.960 --> 33:25.960
JIANG RESIDENCE

33:38.120 --> 33:40.360
The guqin broke. I'm bringing a new one.

33:43.800 --> 33:45.760
Perhaps we can sit
closer together, Ruoyao?

33:49.120 --> 33:49.960
Never mind.

33:50.560 --> 33:52.080
You two can go ahead.

33:52.160 --> 33:53.600
I'll ask Mother for another carriage.

33:54.160 --> 33:56.160
It's such a pity that we can't go

33:56.240 --> 33:57.160
to school together.

33:57.240 --> 34:00.120
See you at the School of Integrity then.

34:01.040 --> 34:01.880
All right.

34:05.920 --> 34:08.480
Miss, Madam Ji left early today.

34:08.560 --> 34:09.960
Where can we get a carriage?

34:10.920 --> 34:11.760
Jiang Li.

34:14.880 --> 34:16.000
Aren't you going to school?

34:18.960 --> 34:19.880
Yes.

34:20.360 --> 34:21.360
I'm about to go.

34:22.040 --> 34:24.000
Where is your sisters' carriage then?

34:25.840 --> 34:26.840
They left.

34:27.840 --> 34:29.400
Never mind. I can walk there.

34:33.800 --> 34:36.199
I am a kindhearted person.

34:36.280 --> 34:37.679
I hate seeing people get mistreated.

34:38.159 --> 34:39.000
Jiang Li.

34:39.080 --> 34:40.159
You can go with me.

34:41.320 --> 34:43.400
- Let's go.
- Load the snacks for me!

34:43.480 --> 34:44.320
All right.

34:44.840 --> 34:47.880
BENEFITTING THE PEOPLE

34:48.760 --> 34:50.760
This is a blessing in disguise for you.

34:51.960 --> 34:53.560
Why squeeze in a carriage with them?

34:53.639 --> 34:54.520
You'll feel aggrieved.

34:55.760 --> 34:57.960
Do they always go to school
in the same carriage?

34:58.640 --> 34:59.640
Not really.

34:59.720 --> 35:00.960
Sometimes, Zhou Yanbang

35:01.640 --> 35:03.000
would pick up Jiang Ruoyao.

35:10.680 --> 35:13.480
Are you going to the School of Integrity

35:13.560 --> 35:15.360
just to meet Zhou Yanbang?

35:16.560 --> 35:17.840
What else could it be?

35:18.520 --> 35:20.480
Isn't it better to stay at home?

35:20.560 --> 35:22.160
Why detain yourself there?

35:22.720 --> 35:24.160
I bet this is about Zhou Yanbang.

35:25.040 --> 35:26.840
Listen to me.

35:26.920 --> 35:28.520
He is already engaged.

35:28.600 --> 35:29.880
He's not worth your time.

35:30.920 --> 35:32.040
I heard

35:32.120 --> 35:33.720
His Majesty would personally meet

35:33.800 --> 35:36.000
the first placer
in the School of Integrity's Annual Exam.

35:36.480 --> 35:38.040
His Majesty will also give a reward.

35:38.840 --> 35:40.200
I want

35:40.680 --> 35:41.520
that reward.

35:45.520 --> 35:48.200
You want to enter the palace for a reward?

35:48.280 --> 35:50.120
What do you take
the School of Integrity for?

35:50.200 --> 35:52.200
You can't simply get first place.

35:52.280 --> 35:54.400
This year's exam will be taken
as a team of four.

35:54.480 --> 35:56.200
The ranking is based on the team.

35:56.280 --> 35:57.560
I doubt anyone will even

35:57.640 --> 35:58.840
team up with you.

36:00.040 --> 36:02.800
The one with the best chance to be
the first placer and meet His Majesty

36:02.880 --> 36:05.440
is the team with Chancellor Li's two sons.

36:06.000 --> 36:07.120
His eldest son Li Jin

36:07.200 --> 36:10.080
is always in the top three
in this year's periodic exams.

36:10.160 --> 36:12.080
He usually keeps a very low profile.

36:12.680 --> 36:13.960
His second son Li Lian

36:14.040 --> 36:15.800
may not be as outstanding as Li Jin,

36:15.880 --> 36:17.760
but he is a skilled organizer.

36:17.840 --> 36:20.200
He is good at gathering
talents and visionaries.

36:20.280 --> 36:21.320
The Li family's sons

36:21.400 --> 36:23.680
are in the top tier
of the School of Integrity.

36:23.760 --> 36:26.880
They are the sons of a powerful
and important official.

36:26.960 --> 36:28.400
Sadly, Li Zhongnan

36:28.480 --> 36:30.960
and Uncle Yuanbai are rivals
in the imperial court,

36:31.040 --> 36:32.800
so we can't team up with them.

36:34.320 --> 36:36.920
It's not a bad thing to team up

36:37.000 --> 36:38.360
with the Jiang sisters too.

36:38.840 --> 36:39.920
Jiang Ruoyao

36:40.000 --> 36:42.560
is the precious daughter
of the Jiang family.

36:42.640 --> 36:44.920
She is the best guqin player
in the School of Integrity.

36:45.520 --> 36:47.920
They may be good with literature

36:48.000 --> 36:49.320
but not with sports.

36:49.400 --> 36:51.640
However, one of them has a good fiancé.

36:52.520 --> 36:55.200
Zhou Yanbang is
an excellent rider and archer.

36:55.280 --> 36:57.160
Not even the sons of the Li family

36:57.240 --> 36:59.560
can match his skills.

37:02.600 --> 37:04.600
SURPASS VIRTUE AND KNOWLEDGE

37:16.880 --> 37:19.960
RESPECT AND EMULATE THE EXCELLENT

37:20.880 --> 37:21.920
Did you see that?

37:22.000 --> 37:23.560
Jiang Ruoyao and Mr. Zhou are

37:23.640 --> 37:25.320
in the School of Integrity's second tier.

37:25.400 --> 37:26.280
They are

37:26.360 --> 37:27.680
from renowned families

37:27.760 --> 37:29.200
and are engaged to each other.

37:29.280 --> 37:31.440
- They are basically inseparable.
- Yes.

37:31.520 --> 37:33.160
No matter how hard you try,

37:33.240 --> 37:34.400
you'll never separate them.

37:34.480 --> 37:36.840
- Is there a third tier?
- Watch where you're going.

37:40.720 --> 37:41.560
You're…

37:42.360 --> 37:43.360
You're Xue…

37:47.040 --> 37:48.360
What are you doing here?

37:50.320 --> 37:51.640
Did you suffer brain damage?

37:51.720 --> 37:53.600
If you can come here,

37:53.680 --> 37:55.760
why can't
the Jiang family's daughter be here?

37:56.880 --> 37:57.760
Yes.

37:57.840 --> 38:00.080
Ms. Jiang Li,
who attempted matricide and fratricide.

38:00.640 --> 38:02.720
Who are you talking about?

38:03.680 --> 38:04.960
Listen up!

38:05.040 --> 38:06.560
If you ever say that again,

38:06.640 --> 38:08.000
I'll make you pay!

38:08.480 --> 38:09.480
Did you see that?

38:09.560 --> 38:10.520
Shen Ruyun.

38:11.080 --> 38:13.080
She is in the third tier
of the School of Integrity.

38:13.160 --> 38:14.520
A family member became successful,

38:14.600 --> 38:17.200
then she rode on his success
and got into the School of Integrity.

38:17.280 --> 38:19.560
Well-respected and influential families
won't hang out with them,

38:19.640 --> 38:22.960
so they can only
form their own little group.

38:23.040 --> 38:25.000
But it's too late for you

38:25.080 --> 38:26.320
to join them now.

38:27.360 --> 38:28.480
Is there a fourth tier?

38:28.560 --> 38:30.160
Yes. That's us.

38:30.240 --> 38:31.960
We're ready any time

38:32.040 --> 38:33.080
to pack up and leave.

38:35.640 --> 38:37.600
The late emperor founded a girls' school

38:38.080 --> 38:40.520
and set up a new area
in the Imperial Academy.

38:40.600 --> 38:42.080
The area was built and was renamed

38:42.160 --> 38:43.880
the School of Integrity.

38:43.960 --> 38:46.920
He wanted women to learn etiquette
and see the big picture.

38:47.880 --> 38:51.000
His Majesty carries on this legacy
and emphasizes women's education,

38:51.080 --> 38:53.920
so he expanded
the School of Integrity's system.

38:54.000 --> 38:55.480
Now, the two schools

38:55.560 --> 38:56.800
don't study together,

38:56.880 --> 38:58.000
but this courtyard

38:58.080 --> 38:58.960
is shared by both.

39:05.720 --> 39:08.360
- Stop it! Stop right there!
- How can you hit me?

39:08.440 --> 39:09.600
- Stop!
- It's me!

39:15.520 --> 39:16.520
Stop!

39:17.440 --> 39:18.800
You hit too hard!

39:18.880 --> 39:19.760
Stop him!

39:20.840 --> 39:21.760
- Come on!
- Enough!

39:22.760 --> 39:23.800
Who is he?

39:24.720 --> 39:25.880
Your cousin.

39:25.960 --> 39:26.800
Do you remember him?

39:28.840 --> 39:30.240
My cousin?

39:30.320 --> 39:32.440
A relative from your mother's side.

39:32.520 --> 39:34.120
He's your cousin, Ye Shijie.

39:35.920 --> 39:36.880
He just came

39:36.960 --> 39:38.040
from Luyang this year.

39:38.120 --> 39:40.160
Wealthy and ranks among the best.

39:40.240 --> 39:41.640
He's the richest in his hometown.

39:41.720 --> 39:43.680
However, he is too much of a loner.

39:44.520 --> 39:46.760
He only reads and never makes friends.

39:46.840 --> 39:48.200
Does he have a team yet?

39:48.280 --> 39:49.520
How is his grades?

39:49.600 --> 39:51.240
He got top-notch grades on literary tests.

39:51.320 --> 39:53.000
Did you think I didn't ask him?

39:53.560 --> 39:54.480
But he

39:55.080 --> 39:56.360
gave me the cold shoulder.

40:22.000 --> 40:25.160
BROADEN KNOWLEDGE WITH PROPRIETY

40:26.280 --> 40:27.360
Who is she?

40:27.440 --> 40:29.000
Who is this girl?

40:31.240 --> 40:32.760
Jiang Li, you're finally here.

40:33.920 --> 40:35.120
Jiang Li?

40:35.200 --> 40:38.080
Is she Jiang Li,
who came back from Zhennv Hall?

40:39.240 --> 40:40.600
A scandal happened

40:40.680 --> 40:42.200
at Zhennv Hall a while ago.

40:43.160 --> 40:45.000
With the influence of such a place,

40:45.080 --> 40:47.000
she probably doesn't behave well.

40:48.680 --> 40:51.680
Is she here for Mr. Zhou?

40:59.680 --> 41:01.400
My sister is new to this school.

41:01.480 --> 41:03.160
I hope you'll bear with her.

41:03.720 --> 41:05.320
If she offends you in any way,

41:05.400 --> 41:07.400
I apologize in advance on her behalf.

41:12.640 --> 41:13.960
Jiang Li.

41:14.040 --> 41:15.280
You came too late.

41:15.360 --> 41:17.760
I saved a seat for you,

41:17.840 --> 41:19.040
but there are too many people,

41:19.120 --> 41:21.920
so I'm embarrassed to keep it for you.

41:22.480 --> 41:24.320
Ruoyao, forget her.

41:24.400 --> 41:25.760
She is older than us.

41:25.840 --> 41:27.040
She can find her own seat.

41:27.640 --> 41:28.680
Yes.

41:28.760 --> 41:31.280
I won't trouble you with that.

41:35.840 --> 41:37.400
- Back to our seats.
- Class is starting.

41:44.200 --> 41:45.880
Are you Jiang Li?

41:45.960 --> 41:50.880
HARMONIOUS RELATIONSHIP

41:50.960 --> 41:51.800
Yes.

41:51.880 --> 41:53.600
Greetings, Ms. Xiao.

41:56.280 --> 41:57.120
Take a seat.

42:04.480 --> 42:06.080
You'll be taking the Annual Exam soon.

42:06.600 --> 42:08.120
I hope you can see me again

42:08.960 --> 42:11.000
when the results are out.

42:12.160 --> 42:13.360
Let the class begin.

42:40.120 --> 42:40.960
Go away!

42:45.920 --> 42:48.440
LIU XU

43:25.840 --> 43:26.960
I'll bring it tomorrow.

43:46.120 --> 43:47.960
I have two gifts for you.

43:48.040 --> 43:50.520
Do you want to see the one
in my left hand or right hand first?

43:50.600 --> 43:51.680
Right hand.

43:53.640 --> 43:55.400
I especially bought this for you.

43:55.480 --> 43:56.640
Your favorite pastries.

44:28.560 --> 44:29.520
What are you looking at?

44:31.480 --> 44:32.440
Isn't that Jiang Li?

44:34.320 --> 44:36.360
I can bring her here,
so can you stare at her all day.

44:37.720 --> 44:39.080
I'm just curious

44:39.160 --> 44:40.760
why she suddenly came to the school.

44:41.520 --> 44:42.960
She's not as qualified as you.

44:44.880 --> 44:45.720
All right.

44:46.200 --> 44:47.440
You haven't seen the gift

44:47.520 --> 44:48.640
on my other hand.

44:49.600 --> 44:51.360
I had this hairpin custom-made for you.

44:51.440 --> 44:52.280
Wear it

44:52.360 --> 44:54.680
and you'll be
the most beautiful Jiang Ruoyao.

44:58.080 --> 44:59.400
Smooth talker.

45:04.320 --> 45:05.800
Interesting.

45:07.600 --> 45:08.440
Look.

45:08.520 --> 45:10.840
She's the Chief Secretariat's daughter.

45:10.920 --> 45:13.080
Don't you think
she is prettier than Ruoyao?

45:13.160 --> 45:15.800
I heard she was Zhou Yanbang's
original fiancée.

45:16.360 --> 45:18.680
The younger sister stole
the older sister's fiancé.

45:18.760 --> 45:20.560
Will the older sister get him back?

45:20.640 --> 45:22.120
Given her tarnished reputation,

45:22.200 --> 45:24.240
after the Marquis of Ningyuan
canceled the engagement,

45:24.320 --> 45:25.440
no one else proposed.

45:25.520 --> 45:26.440
I should try my luck

45:27.080 --> 45:28.160
and make her my concubine.

45:28.240 --> 45:29.440
Try it if you can.

45:30.920 --> 45:31.760
Let's go.

45:33.160 --> 45:35.880
Ms. Jiang Li, care to join me
for some tea later?

45:43.200 --> 45:44.040
What was that for?

45:45.240 --> 45:46.400
A bunch of men who gossip

45:46.480 --> 45:49.080
about the School of Integrity's
female students in broad daylight.

45:49.160 --> 45:50.240
You should be ashamed.

45:50.320 --> 45:51.360
You're a brute

45:51.440 --> 45:53.240
who dares to argue against men.

45:53.320 --> 45:54.680
No men in the city would marry you!

45:55.440 --> 45:56.920
If I have to be virtuous

45:57.000 --> 45:59.000
just to marry someone of your standards,

45:59.080 --> 46:00.720
I'd rather shave my head and become a nun.

46:00.800 --> 46:01.680
What did you say?

46:01.760 --> 46:02.760
You…

46:02.840 --> 46:04.320
What did you say?

46:04.400 --> 46:07.080
Forget it. Don't argue with her.

46:07.160 --> 46:09.680
Liu Xu from the School of Integrity
is famous for her rudeness.

46:09.760 --> 46:10.600
Let's go.

46:10.680 --> 46:11.520
- Come on.
- Such bad luck.

46:24.480 --> 46:25.440
You…

46:25.520 --> 46:27.200
- Let's go.
- Forget it.

46:27.280 --> 46:28.200
Come on.

46:28.280 --> 46:30.000
- Let's go.
- Such bad luck.

46:31.080 --> 46:32.200
- Come on.
- I…

46:32.280 --> 46:33.760
- If she weren't a girl…
- Forget it.

46:33.840 --> 46:34.680
- All right.
- Thank you.

46:35.600 --> 46:36.920
I wasn't helping you.

46:37.000 --> 46:38.560
I hate it when people get in my way.

46:50.480 --> 46:51.320
I know you.

46:51.400 --> 46:53.720
You used my mother at the Zhennv Hall.

46:53.800 --> 46:56.320
The elders like you, but I don't.

46:56.400 --> 46:57.400
You're full of schemes.

46:57.480 --> 47:00.200
I've heard that you're a candid person.

47:00.880 --> 47:02.280
The rumors didn't disappoint.

47:02.360 --> 47:03.800
I'm magnanimous,

47:03.880 --> 47:06.120
unlike the scheming
and treacherous kind you are.

47:14.440 --> 47:16.880
My lord, news from the Red Pavilion.

47:16.960 --> 47:18.960
A customer by the alias "Lonely Gentleman"

47:19.040 --> 47:20.520
always splurged his money.

47:20.600 --> 47:22.120
He got drunk lately

47:22.200 --> 47:23.920
and said he can't frequent
the place anymore.

47:24.000 --> 47:26.120
I bet that coward's
stream of revenue is cut off

47:26.200 --> 47:27.200
but wants to save face.

47:28.160 --> 47:29.800
What's the Lonely Gentleman's background?

47:29.880 --> 47:32.560
He's from Qiantang and came
to the capital a couple of years ago.

47:32.640 --> 47:33.600
Qiantang?

47:34.080 --> 47:36.640
Judge Kong's wife
is from Qiantang as well.

47:36.720 --> 47:37.960
Duke Su.

47:38.040 --> 47:38.920
My apologies.

47:39.000 --> 47:40.520
Your regular booth on the second floor

47:40.600 --> 47:41.720
is occupied today.

47:41.800 --> 47:43.640
I'll prepare another booth for you.

47:43.720 --> 47:45.200
Are you new here?

47:45.280 --> 47:46.760
Don't you know that is Duke Su's spot?

47:47.320 --> 47:48.680
It couldn't be helped.

47:48.760 --> 47:51.000
Mr. Li insisted on taking the booth.

47:51.080 --> 47:52.200
I offered a different spot,

47:52.280 --> 47:53.920
but he wouldn't take it.

47:54.960 --> 47:56.000
Mr. Li?

47:58.560 --> 47:59.560
We rarely get to meet.

48:00.280 --> 48:01.280
I'll share his table.

48:01.960 --> 48:04.080
Duke Su, they ordered us

48:04.160 --> 48:05.320
not to disturb them.

48:05.400 --> 48:06.240
Do you think…

48:14.920 --> 48:16.160
Messrs. Li.

48:17.000 --> 48:18.080
You're in a good mood today.

48:25.640 --> 48:28.000
What's your business here, Duke Su?

48:28.560 --> 48:30.160
I'm not always working.

48:31.280 --> 48:33.880
Today, I'm here for some tea.

48:33.960 --> 48:35.520
The view here is stunning.

48:36.320 --> 48:39.040
But we've taken the spot.

48:39.720 --> 48:41.520
If it's tea you want,

48:41.600 --> 48:42.720
sit somewhere else.

48:43.480 --> 48:45.080
As for the tea,

48:46.160 --> 48:47.280
it's on me.

48:47.960 --> 48:49.080
That's fine.

48:49.160 --> 48:52.520
I don't usually fancy a crowd.

48:52.600 --> 48:55.040
But I'm in a good mood today.

48:55.720 --> 48:56.720
I'll join you for a while.

49:00.040 --> 49:02.760
Mr. Li, what are you looking at?
